OL,3,AImmigrants held in small outdoor cages
OL,4,Aat 'Alligator Alcatraz' in Florida,
OL,5,Ainvestigators find
OL,6,
OL,7,FImmigrants held at "Alligator
OL,8,FAlcatraz", a now-shuttered detention
OL,9,Fcentre in Florida, were kept in small
OL,10,Fmetal cages for hours, according to a
OL,11,Freport from the US Department of
OL,12,FHomeland Security's watchdog.
OL,14,FThe Office of the Inspector General
OL,15,F(OIG) found the use of the outdoor
OL,16,Fcages - about 18sq ft (1.67sq m) - was
OL,17,F"unprecedented among detention
OL,18,Ffacilities" and dangerous.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
