OL,3,AImmigrants held in small outdoor cages
OL,4,Aat 'Alligator Alcatraz' in Florida,
OL,5,Ainvestigators find
OL,6,
OL,7,FInvestigators concluded the centre also
OL,8,Fdid not comply with a number of
OL,9,Fstandards for hygiene, medical care,
OL,10,Ffood, health and safety.
OL,12,FThe BBC has contacted DHS's Immigration
OL,13,Fand Customs Enforcement (ICE) and
OL,14,FFlorida Governor Ron DeSantis for
OL,15,Fcomment. DHS told the watchdog that
OL,16,Fstate officials ran the facility.
